<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" itunes:timing="Word"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="Connection"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="OneRepublic"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Connection - Single"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USUM71808832"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1401489355"/><iTunesMetadata xmlns="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal"><translations><translation xml:lang="zh-Hans" type="subtitle"><text for="L1">近来我的心潮迷失在茫茫海洋</text><text for="L2">七十亿人浮游世间 而我只是在机械地过活</text><text for="L3">我燃起求救的信号 只盼爱与真心相守</text><text for="L4">我把心意交给陌生面孔 换来的却是空洞念想</text><text for="L5">或许我该试着找回从前的自己</text><text for="L6">带我回到那些熟悉之地 回到懂我的人身边</text><text for="L7">我只想与人相连 也许你能为我指引</text><text for="L8">若身边人潮如此汹涌 为何我仍孤独难当</text><text for="L9">能否寻得一份心灵相契</text><text for="L10">能否 能否让我与谁真正相连<span ttm:role="x-bg">(孤单)</span></text><text for="L11">能否觅得一份心灵相通</text><text for="L12">能否 能否找到彼此相知的人</text><text for="L13">真心相待的朋友实在难寻 不如直面现实</text><text for="L14">买下梦寐以求的家 地下室却遭了水患</text><text for="L15">如今挣了些钱 我也不想再追逐更多</text><text for="L16">俄克拉荷马来的我们 可不想虚度此生</text><text for="L17">我只想为自己描绘一幅人生图景</text><text for="L18">找一件或许四十年后仍值得我在意的事</text><text for="L19">届时我会准备就绪 也愿意且有能力改写故事</text><text for="L20">身边明明这么多人 我却仍孤独至极</text><text for="L21">能否找到一份真切联结</text><text for="L22">能否 能否让心与心彼此相通<span ttm:role="x-bg">(寂寞)</span></text><text for="L23">能否与谁真心相连</text><text for="L24">能否 能否找到懂我知我的人<span ttm:role="x-bg">(形单影只)</span></text><text for="L25">我从自己的倒影里看见那份孤单</text><text for="L26">哦 能否让我与人真正相连</text><text for="L27">能否 能否寻得一份心灵相通</text><text for="L28">孤独</text><text for="L29">此刻 此刻 我要驶向另一条路</text><text for="L30">脚踩油门向前 只为寻觅真实所求</text><text for="L31">有时需要有人相伴 并不丢人</text><text for="L32">朝云端高声呼喊</text><text for="L33">我不禁问 能否与谁心意相通</text><text for="L34">能否 能否觅得一份真实联结<span ttm:role="x-bg">(孤独)</span></text><text for="L35">能否找到与人相通的感觉</text><text for="L36">能否 能否让两颗心真正相连<span ttm:role="x-bg">(落寞)</span></text><text for="L37">镜中倒影映出我心底的孤单</text><text for="L38">哦 能否觅得一份心灵相通</text><text for="L39">能否 能否遇见真正懂我的人</text><text for="L40">仍想找回从前的自己<span ttm:role="x-bg">(孤单)</span></text></translation></translations><songwriters><songwriter>Noel Zancanella</songwriter><songwriter>Zach Skelton</songwriter><songwriter>Jacob Kasher Hindlin</songwriter><songwriter>Brent Kutzle</songwriter><songwriter>Ryan Tedder &amp; Kevin Fisher</songwriter></songwriters></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="2:20.235"><div begin="0:05.535" end="2:20.235"><p begin="0:05.535" end="0:08.775" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:05.535" end="0:05.935">These</span> <span begin="0:05.935" end="0:06.275">days</span> <span begin="0:06.275" end="0:06.605">my</span> <span begin="0:06.605" end="0:07.005">waves</span> <span begin="0:07.005" end="0:07.305">get</span> <span begin="0:07.305" end="0:07.765">lost</span> <span begin="0:07.765" end="0:07.883">in</span> <span begin="0:07.883" end="0:08.053">the</span> <span begin="0:08.053" end="0:08.775">oceans</span></p><p begin="0:08.775" end="0:11.625" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:08.775" end="0:08.965">Sev</span><span begin="0:08.965" end="0:09.155">en</span> <span begin="0:09.155" end="0:09.285">bil</span><span begin="0:09.285" end="0:09.475">lion</span> <span begin="0:09.475" end="0:09.685">swim</span><span begin="0:09.685" end="0:09.865">mers,</span> <span begin="0:09.865" end="0:10.115">man</span> <span begin="0:10.115" end="0:10.245">I'm</span> <span begin="0:10.245" end="0:10.445">go</span><span begin="0:10.445" end="0:10.565">ing</span> <span begin="0:10.565" end="0:10.775">through</span> <span begin="0:10.775" end="0:10.855">the</span> <span begin="0:10.855" end="0:11.155">mo</span><span begin="0:11.155" end="0:11.625">tions</span></p><p begin="0:11.6